    purpose: "Compare bounded candidate experiments and surface a method recommendation without silently promoting a candidate or changing the active method",
    settlement: "Rejected candidates remain rejected; the best candidate remains unsettled; the active method changes only after explicit human acceptance of a recommendation",
    steps: "freeze parent and criterion -> run candidate rounds within the budget -> score each candidate and preserve lineage -> review repeated residuals -> record a candidate-only method recommendation -> human accepts or leaves the active method unchanged",
