    settlement: "Message has ordered sequence, correlation, sender, recipient and target Assignment; one run-boundary receipt atomically records the eligible batch and acknowledgements; replay returns the same batch",
    steps: "sender submits bounded addressed message -> mutation boundary revalidates sender, recipient, Team and Assignment -> CAS appends message -> running recipient reaches its next model decision -> recorded consume command CAS-commits boundary receipt and acknowledgements -> agent incorporates the batch as untrusted user content",
    variants: "cancelled or superseded messages are excluded; stale/duplicate consume returns recorded result; messages arriving during model generation wait for the next decision; no tool or authority set changes"
}

